Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We want our customers to have a smooth and seamless journey every time they fly with us, so I'm sorry to hear about the unexpected expense you incurred due to the schedule change/flight delay of QFXXX, dd/mm/yyyy.<br />
<br />
I’d like to apologise on behalf of Qantas for the flight delay/cancellation and the impact on your plans.<br />
<br />
We would be happy to review a claim for the cost of accommodation you have paid for as a result of the flight delay/cancellation.<br />
<br />
<strong>Next steps</strong><br />
Please respond to this email attaching your receipts. We’ll review the submitted receipts and notify you of the outcome.<br />
<br />
<strong>We're here to help</strong><br />
If you have travel insurance, please let us know if you require an insurance letter to confirm details of your trip.</p>
